      "statement": "Scope: the run run:5ce89f521e5e is a bounded replay (not cancelled, clink exit status 0, 3 of 3 jobs completed) of 50,000 events. It holds 50,000 transfers, 12,072 accounts, 12,321 devices, 691 onward links and 6 fan-in alerts. Fan-in means at least 5 distinct senders inside one event-time hour. An onward link means a debit within 1,800,000 ms (30 min) after a credit. Everything below holds only for this dataset as this run processed it.",
